### Create `merge` `TraitsOption` for `objectArrayTrait`

Fixes https://github.com/TerriaJS/terriajs/issues/5048

## Example - `LegendTraits`

### Before

#### DEA coastlines WMS uses custom legend url in catalog:

```json
{
  "legends": [
    {
      "url": "https://data.dea.ga.gov.au/projects/coastlines/DEACoastLines_legend 1.png"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### WMS GetCapabilitiesStratum will then add default legends on top:

For GeoServer WMS we request high DPI legends and use imageScaling=0.5 to scale it back to original size

```json
{
  "legends": [
    {
      "url": "https://geoserver.dea.ga.gov.au/geoserver/wms?service=WMS&version=1.3.0&request=GetLegendGraphic&format=image%2Fpng&layer=dea%3ADEACoastLines&LEGEND_OPTIONS=fontName%3ACourier%3BfontStyle%3Abold%3BfontSize%3A12%3BforceLabels%3Aon%3BfontAntiAliasing%3Atrue%3BlabelMargin%3A5%3BfontColor%3A0xffffff%3Bdpi%3A182&transparent=true",
      "imageScaling": 0.5,
      "urlMimeType": "image/png"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### This results with:
```json
{
  "legends": [
    {
      "url": "https://data.dea.ga.gov.au/projects/coastlines/DEACoastLines_legend 1.png",
      "imageScaling": 0.5,
      "urlMimeType": "image/png"
    }
  ]
}
```

Which is wrong, as this legend should have no `imageScaling` or `urlMimeType` traits.

### Before vs After

![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6187649/108318009-3e4b4f00-7213-11eb-8aa4-5beb49af8c86.png)

### After 

We have set `merge: false` in `LegendTraits`

```ts
@objectArrayTrait({
    name: "Legend URLs",
    description: "The legends to display on the workbench.",
    type: LegendTraits,
    idProperty: "index",
    merge: false
  })
  legends?: LegendTraits[];
```

Now we don't merge trait values across strata for a given `idProperty` (`index` in this case) - so the manually defined legend will **completely** overwrite the WMS `GetCapabilitiesStratum` legend.

#### So we get the correct result

```json
{
  "legends": [
    {
      "url": "https://data.dea.ga.gov.au/projects/coastlines/DEACoastLines_legend 1.png"
    }
  ]
}
```

